{
  "name": "01 - Company Knowledge Ingestion - Supabase RAG",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 01 — Company Knowledge Ingestion\n\nUpload company documents through the n8n form. The workflow extracts text, splits it into chunks, creates 3072-dimensional Gemini embeddings, and inserts them into the Supabase `documents` table.\n\n### After importing\n1. Open **Supabase Vector Store** and select/create the Supabase credential.\n2. Open **Embeddings Google Gemini** and select/create the Gemini credential.\n3. Click **Test workflow**, open the form, and upload a small document.\n\nNever place the Supabase service-role key in a website or frontend.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 620
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0,0],
      "id": "d8877ed3-a9dd-42e3-a134-998fc2d74211",
      "name": "Setup Instructions"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Upload Company Knowledge",
        "formDescription": "Upload a company document to add it to the Enterprise RAG knowledge base. Supported formats: PDF, DOCX, TXT, and CSV.",
        "formFields": {"values":[
          {"fieldLabel":"Company Name","placeholder":"Example Enterprise Ltd.","requiredField":true},
          {"fieldLabel":"Document Category","fieldType":"dropdown","fieldOptions":{"values":[{"option":"Company Overview"},{"option":"Products and Services"},{"option":"Policies"},{"option":"FAQs"},{"option":"Support"},{"option":"Other"}]},"requiredField":true},
          {"fieldLabel":"Company Document","fieldType":"file","multipleFiles":false,"acceptFileTypes":".pdf,.docx,.txt,.csv","requiredField":true}
        ]},
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {"buttonLabel":"Add to Knowledge Base"}
      },
      "type":"n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger","typeVersion":2.3,"position":[304,352],"id":"73d1e626-a98e-468a-8664-61d48ee0a793","name":"Upload Company Document"
    },
    {
      "parameters":{"mode":"insert","tableName":{"__rl":true,"value":"documents","mode":"list","cachedResultName":"documents"},"options":{"queryName":"match_documents"}},
      "type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.vectorStoreSupabase","typeVersion":1.3,"position":[672,352],"id":"8d5f37f9-2a22-4ed6-a358-8c80ffd69abe","name":"Supabase Vector Store"
    },
    {
      "parameters":{"modelName":"models/gemini-embedding-001"},"type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.embeddingsGoogleGemini","typeVersion":1,"position":[592,560],"id":"40e7a292-d0f0-45fa-81f0-d90e42fc64e9","name":"Embeddings Google Gemini"
    },
    {
      "parameters":{"dataType":"binary","textSplittingMode":"custom","options":{"metadata":{"metadataValues":[
