    {
      "parameters":{"content":"## Credentials required\n\n**Supabase Vector Store**\n- Host: `https://YOUR_PROJECT_REF.supabase.co`\n- Secret: configure the Supabase `service_role` key inside n8n credentials\n\n**Embeddings Google Gemini**\n- Configure your Google Gemini API key inside n8n credentials\n- Model: `models/gemini-embedding-001`\n\nThis public export intentionally contains no API keys or secrets.","height":330,"width":470},
